      "id": 1,
      "text": "Claryville sits just north of the Neversink River, a hamlet that once hosted a main street, church, and post office.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
